{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_brigid_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_brigid_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"临行日","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在废墟中寻到两个幸存者，布莉吉将其托付给涅梅丝带领的队伍负责营救。而当她再次回到那片废墟时，却意外见到被抛弃在此的其中一人。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_brigid_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["驮兽","布莉吉","？？？","女人的声音","涅梅丝","深池士兵","伊芙琳"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_bg_bg_wild_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcknmrn","volume":"0.3","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（嗅闻）","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（走动）","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（用蹄子拍打地面）","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞——！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","duration":"1.5","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"怎么了？你发现什么了？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞哞——！","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","id":27},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":28,"musicid":0},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"有人？在哪个方向，带我过去。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"这次我们提前通知到了呀，周围也撤离得很及时，刚才一路过来看到的房子基本都早就清空，按理来说应该不会有人没赶上。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞——","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"就是这里吗？可我什么也没看到。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（用鼻子拱废墟上的石块）","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"哎，先别动了！虽然我看不见，但万一真的有活人在这下面呢？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"大个子，让开点。让我过去，别傻乎乎地挡在那里了。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stnecrve","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你好？能听见吗？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":54},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我是游牧人布莉吉，要是你听得见，也能动弹的话，就找个硬一点的东西，像我这样轻轻敲一下。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"静谧，长久的静谧，布莉吉几乎要以为她的驮兽伙伴只是判断错误了。她环视四周，看到不远处倒塌的房屋，散开的物资包......","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"距离天灾发生已经过去至少二十四个小时，能搜救到幸存者的概率本就渺茫。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......好吧，应该是没有活人。大个子，你是不是找错了？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（愤怒地用蹄子拍打地面）","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我知道，我知道！但这不是没声音吗？可能有什么东西误导了你。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stnecrve","volume":"0.2","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞——！","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"等等......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":78},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stnecrve","volume":"0.2","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（轻敲石砖）","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（模糊的人声）","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......真的有人！","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我在，我在！跟我说说话吧，你周围有光线吗？只有一个人？还是说——","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"——女儿——","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"布莉吉趴下去，把耳朵贴到能更清晰地听见声音的石块边缘。她用力往地面上凑，试图辨别幸存者所发出的每一个音节。","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"救......","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"可能你还得说得更清楚点！","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"救救......我的女儿......","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你的女儿？你们下面现在是有两个人，对吗？你女儿状态怎么样，在你身边吗？","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"一阵琐碎的响动之后，女人的声音更清晰了些。","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"这周围都是黑的，我看不清......我们都被埋在下面......她晕过去了，我不知道......","id":98},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"求求你，救救我们——","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你女儿在你附近吗？","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"是的，是的......她就在我怀里，我们被压在石块下面——","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你抱着她？那你深呼吸，然后仔细听，感受她。她是不是还在呼吸，是不是还很温暖？","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"......呃......是、是的！","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"好，那接下来，你要一直跟我说话。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"人在精神突然放松之后也很容易昏过去，所以我需要你慢慢和我说话。","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"说点什么吧，随便说点什么。比如你女儿多大了，你的头发是什么颜色......","id":109},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"游牧人从地上轻巧地爬起来，取下身上的铃铛，举起来，往更开阔的地方走出几步。","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bellshake","volume":"1","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"在铃声和风声中，她向同样游荡在原野上的同伴发出求援的讯息。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"......我女儿，三岁大了，我的头发是红色的......","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"种族呢？我是佩洛。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"菲林......我和女儿都是菲林......","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你叫什么名字？","id":121},{"type":"charslot","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"我叫伊芙琳......","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"嗯，你女儿呢——","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"你说什么？我听不清了。","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"游牧人，游牧人？你还在吗？","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":131},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我在，我在向我的同伴求援。你很勇敢，你保护了她，现在，只要等我的同伴过来，我们就能把你们一起救出来。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"什么？还要等......？","id":135},{"type":"charslot","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"不......没有，没有时间了......","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"有的！你还有精神，女儿也活着，就在你怀里。这里能够准确定位，目前也没有余震迹象......你们都能得救的，相信我！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"可我——可我感觉不到我的腿，就算出去了也只是个废人！","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"什——","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"所以，别管我，也别等你的同伴了，求求你，游牧人，就只是帮我把孩子救出去——","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"求你了！","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"就算双腿不在了，可你的眼睛还在，双手还在。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你还能用眼睛去看，用手去触摸。你从天灾里保护了自己的女儿，却要在这里......把她抛下？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"为什么？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"不，游牧人，你不懂。你不懂......","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"也许我是不懂，但你可以解释给我听。“一直跟我说话”，记得吗？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"但你要慢慢说，不要像刚才那样大声，不然很快就会口干舌燥，没有力气的。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女人的声音","text":"不......","id":161},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......布莉吉？","id":164},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"嗯？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#1$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝！你收到我的讯息了？你来得好快！","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"讯息？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#1$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"就是我之前教你听风的方法，你忘了？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不对，你肯定记得，不然也不会这么准确就找到我在哪儿。但这都不重要，你来得正好，快过来这边——","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_244","duration":"1","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"深池士兵","text":"“守灵人”，我们的任务很紧急，不能耽误时间了......","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我记得，没关系。这是我的朋友，一位塔拉的游牧民。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝，你身边这些士兵......？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"深池的救援小队，我们从纳斯尔纱一道过来。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"哦。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"总之你们是来救人的，对不对？虽然附近那个小型移动城市的居民们已经安全撤离了，但还有人没赶上，我发现了两个幸存者。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"就在这片区域的下方吗？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"对，就在我刚才站的那块儿地方。一对母女，妈妈还有意识，能说话，女儿也还活着，只是昏过去了。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我猜接下来你还要去其他地方继续排查。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"是啊，要去的。我发出信息就是想让在附近的同伴过来，几个人一起行动总快过一个，之后也好赶紧去别的地方看看。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"那么，现在我们来了。你可以先去其他地方，深池会接手这里的救援。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_244","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"深池士兵","text":"“守灵人”，“校官”交代的救援任务——","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我知道，但这下面也有两位塔拉幸存者，而深池是塔拉的深池，不是吗？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我们接手这里的救援，你看这样可以吗，布莉吉？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"当然可以啊。反正我们以前也这样合作过，而且你现在还有更多帮手，也用不上我了。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"跟我来吧，我把具体位置指给你。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......可以分头行动，留一部分人在这里实施救援，另一部分人跟我——","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_244","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"深池士兵","text":"“守灵人”。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你语气很焦虑。那对母女的情况怎么样？","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_244","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"深池士兵","text":"整体情况和那个游牧民走之前说的差不多，但哪怕现在所有人一起清理碎石，腾出保障两个人安全的空间再行施救，都需要很多时间。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_244","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"深池士兵","text":"我们这次主要的任务......那群被维多利亚人围住的难民可能等不了太久。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"所以甚至不能分头行动，否则速度更慢。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_244","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"深池士兵","text":"是。而且那个母亲一定要跟你说话，她说要找这里能做决定的人。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"那就让我来跟她沟通吧。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_wild_a.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......这里，我们之前好像来过啊？这不是我们发现那对母女的地方吗？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝他们好像已经撤离了，人也应该早都救走了。大个子，你又带我绕路，是不是吃得太饱了？","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞——！哞哞！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（冲向前方）","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"哎，你去哪儿！我也就是说说，你别乱跑！","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你——","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"这......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"charslot","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"废墟遮挡了深埋其中的躯体，直到走近，布莉吉才从那被土灰覆盖的灰色面庞上辨认出一丝鲜艳的红。","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"那是女人头发的颜色。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......伊芙琳？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"（微弱的呼吸声）","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"还有呼吸——嘿，伊芙琳！醒醒！","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"伊芙琳！","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"咳、咳咳、呃......","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你是伊芙琳吗？为什么只有你被留下了？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......涅梅丝呢？那些深池的人呢？他们本来该救你的——","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"大人......","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"......救救我的孩子......带她走......","id":285},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"求求你......","id":287},{"type":"charslot","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"不要放弃她，也不要回来救我......带她走！","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......什么？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"我已经......告诉过你了。","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你说了什么，我不知道呀，你得再说一次......","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"游牧人开始用随身携带的工具去挖那些困住女人的碎石砖块。但一个人的效率毕竟太低，赶不上女人声音逐渐低迷下去的速度。","id":298},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":299,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"那些石头......我肯定......感染了......","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"就算活下来，也不会被......接纳......","id":303},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"......而且，我的腿......我动不了......","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"我只会成为负担。","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"嗬......","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不不不，不是这样的——","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不是这样！","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"您也......不要靠近我了，大人......","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我......我——","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"charslot","id":319},{"type":"text","text":"“我会救你”“我能救你”，哪个是自己想说出口的？","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"没有一句能够实现。布莉吉发现废墟已经因先前的救援行动而改变了形态，卡在女人腰间的残砖断壁既支撑着她，也在逐渐杀死她。","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......“几个人一起行动总快过一个”。最快的方法......","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"他们把挡在你头顶的砖石直接掀开，让两侧失去支撑，碎石、砖块，所有的重量都流向卡住你的地方。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"因为知道你会保护你的孩子，会坚持下来，直到他们从你手中安全地带走她。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"是不是？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"text","text":"现实的讽刺之处在于，正是对孩子的救援导致了眼前母亲的无援，就算有人折返回来也无济于事。","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"可涅梅丝，她怎么能......她怎么能允许他们这么做？","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"明明可以救下两个人，只是慢一些——","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（悲鸣）","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"咳......咳咳。别费劲了，大人。","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......我——你——","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你还有什么想要的吗？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"嗯，我听见他们......叫您，“守灵人”......","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你在说涅梅丝？我不是她，也不是守灵人。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"......我不知道您究竟是不是真的......但......","id":350},{"type":"charslot","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"等我彻底......咽了气......您能不能......","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"能不能用守灵人的方式......埋葬我？","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我......","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"嘶......咳......","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"女人就快说不出话来了，胸腔像破口的风箱一样耸动，却不具任何效用。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"那个时间很近了，近在眼前。","id":362},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"咳呃——","id":364},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"女人眉头紧蹙，灰败的脸竟然因为疼痛而突然泛红。","id":367},{"type":"charslot","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"呜......","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"text","text":"游牧人于是停止了无用的挖掘。她抬起手，将自己粗糙带血的掌心贴上女人扭曲而紧绷的前额。","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......这样做，可以吗？以前我看见涅梅丝——我看见守灵人这样做过。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"安抚病痛中的人们，宽慰失去家人的孩子，像这样轻轻一抚，所有的痛苦都能驱散。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"但我的手只是游牧人的手......","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（用鼻子拱布莉吉）","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"大个子，你去贴着伊芙琳，说不定能让她觉得暖和点。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"......守灵人？艾娃，你带走艾娃了吗？我的女儿——","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"带走了，她已经安全了，现在你可以放松，别再说话了......","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"啊——啊......谢谢你......真的谢谢你。","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"咳、咳，您还在这里。我想......","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你还想要什么？","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"我想看看——纳斯尔纱——","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你想看看纳斯尔纱。好，我记下了。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"呃——啊！！","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"好痛......我好痛......！明明......明明我的腿已经没有知觉，可为什么——","id":404},{"type":"charslot","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"嘶——咳、咳咳咳！","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞——！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"别再说话了......","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"......嘶......","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"睡吧，伊芙琳。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊芙琳","text":"咳......啊......","id":416},{"type":"dialog","id":417},{"type":"charslot","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"女人最后重重呼出一口气，位于地面之上的半个身躯彻底瘫软下去。布莉吉这才发现，她的身体似乎早已被卡在四周的砖石折断。","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞——","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（用力拱布莉吉）","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我知道，伙计。我们得带她走，不能让她留在这里变成牙兽的食物。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"所以来吧，搭把手......","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"让我们带她去看看纳斯尔纱。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"charslot","id":435},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g8_blackforest_n.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":439},{"type":"text","text":"黑林默许了游牧人的进入。一人一驮兽，带着逝者来到了森林的边缘。","id":440},{"type":"text","text":"再往前，明亮的、砖砌石铸的纳斯尔纱就伫立在道路的尽头。","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"呼......","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"对不起，伊芙琳，我燃起的篝火总是不够大，没法像你想要的那样，像守灵人一样为你还火。","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#2$1","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"而且，我总觉得你没有感染。感染者在死后身体有可能会爆炸，可就算我等到天黑，你也只是这么安静，什么反应也没有。","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"而且，就算你感染了，你也不该这样死的。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"走在路上的时候，我想过带你去遗迹里面，去找真正的守灵人。可你也说过，你想看看纳斯尔纱。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"所以想来想去，最后只能带你来这里了。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（低声哀鸣）","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"往好处想想呢？也许......","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"也许涅梅丝已经带艾娃回到了纳斯尔纱，我把你埋在这里，既妨碍不到别人，你也能远远地看见，甚至听见她们......也说不定。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（衔来野花放在墓前）","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"大个子，好伙计，去帮我也找点这样的花来——","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......算了，我自己去吧。你就在这里陪着伊芙琳。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":468},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":469},{"type":"charslot","id":470},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":471},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"38_g21_skystarry_L1/38_g21_skystarry_r1/38_g21_skystarry_L2/38_g21_skystarry_r2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-1280","id":472},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"80","yFrom":"0","yTo":"300","block":"false","id":473},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":474},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":475},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"1","id":476},{"type":"text","text":"布莉吉走出黑林，来到更开阔的地界上。","id":477},{"type":"text","text":"在这里，树叶晃动的窸窣声响不再会扰乱风声，她得以清晰地向友人传递接下来的话语。","id":478},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bellshake","volume":"1","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"离群的守灵人，如果你仍然在听着......","id":480},{"type":"dialog","id":481},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我想问，你以心火发起的誓言是否仍有效力？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":482},{"type":"subtitle","text":"若有，那为何将可拯救者人为地抛却？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":483},{"type":"subtitle","text":"若无，那又为何轻易向他人许下诺言？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":484},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我胸中有疑惑与愤怒，我希望你能来见我。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":485},{"type":"subtitle","text":"如此，在夜幕下，在黑林的见证中......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":486},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我才能看清相隔千里的人是否仍然与我同行。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":487},{"type":"subtitle","id":488},{"type":"dialog","id":489},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......接下来，摘点花吧。","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"等花草打成蝴蝶一样的绳结，涅梅丝就会来的。像以前一样，翻过遗迹的石墙，穿越灯塔熄灭的海岬......来见我。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"在天亮之前，她会来的。","id":493},{"type":"dialog","id":494},{"type":"charslot","id":495},{"type":"gridbg","id":496},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_bg_59_g7_blackforest_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":497},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":498},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":499},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":500},{"type":"text","text":"两束不辨品类的小花，一束用落叶裹起，摆在红发女子小小的坟墓前，一束打成绳结，放在席地而坐的游牧人脚边。","id":501},{"type":"text","text":"她等待，从夤夜至黎明，只为消解盘桓胸中的疑惑，直到那些要问的话语都在日出的瞬间失去效力。","id":502},{"type":"text","text":"她不再等了。","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（用鼻子轻轻拱布莉吉）","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"她没有来。","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"（轻蹭）","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你说，会不会以前的每次......其实她都是这样选的？只是我没有发现。","id":513,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"她一直都和其他的守灵人有些不一样。而从她离开遗迹，离开原野，走进那些架在轮子上的城市后......","id":515,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"她就更不一样了。","id":517,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","id":518},{"type":"dialogue","name":"驮兽","text":"哞，哞哞——","id":519,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#2$1","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我知道，大个子。天已经亮了，她不会来了。","id":521,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"走吧！我们也在这里等得够久了。","id":523,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":524},{"type":"charslot","id":525},{"type":"text","text":"布莉吉在驮兽的支撑下站起身，将绳结留在原地，活动着因寒冷和久坐而僵硬的四肢。","id":526},{"type":"text","text":"她将最后一眼投向身旁小小的坟堆，而不是身后为太阳所照耀的移动城市。","id":527},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"再见，伊芙琳。","id":529,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":530},{"type":"charslot","id":531},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":532},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":533},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":534},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":535},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":536},{"type":"dialog","id":537},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":538},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":539},{"type":"text","text":"在游牧人早已远去的身后，另一双手将那枚干枯发黄的绳结从地上拾起。","id":540},{"type":"dialog","id":541},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":542},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......","id":543,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"布莉吉？","id":545,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":546},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":547},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":548},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":549},{"type":"charslot","id":550},{"type":"image","id":551}],"characters":["驮兽","布莉吉","？？？","女人的声音","涅梅丝","深池士兵","伊芙琳"]}